 रेज़िस्टर के न जोड़ें।","zh":"V2 的一个引脚只能提供 1 到 4 mA。千万不要不加电阻就接 LED。"},"connections":[{"color":"yellow","from":"A","to":"P1"},{"color":"black","from":"K","to":"GND"}],"note":{"de":"Klemm Ring 1 über einen 470-Ω-Widerstand an das lange Bein der LED und das kurze Bein an GND: etwa 3 mA.","en":"Clip ring 1 to the LED's long leg through a 470 Ω resistor and the short leg to GND: about 3 mA.","es":"Engancha el anillo 1 a la pata larga del LED a través de una resistencia de 470 Ω y la pata corta a GND: unos 3 mA.","fr":"Reliez l'anneau 1 à la patte longue de la LED à travers une résistance de 470 Ω, et la patte courte à GND : environ 3 mA.","hi":"छल्ला 1 को 470 Ω रेज़िस्टर के ज़रिए LED की लंबी टाँग पर क्लिप करें और छोटी टाँग को GND पर: लगभग 3 mA।","zh":"把 1 号环孔经过一个 470 Ω 电阻夹到 LED 的长脚，短脚夹到 GND：约 3 mA。"},"part":"led","supplyVolts":3.3}],"v":1}},"format":"iynk.project","guide":{"callouts":[{"target":"SW2","text":{"de":"Taster A: zählt Drücke","en":"Button A: counts presses","es":"Botón A: cuenta las pulsaciones","fr":"Bouton A : compte les appuis","hi":"बटन A: दबाव गिनता है","zh":"A 按钮：统计按下次数"}},{"target":"SW3","text":{"de":"Taster B: halten lässt die LED leuchten","en":"Button B: hold to light the LED","es":"Botón B: mantenlo para encender el LED","fr":"Bouton B : maintenez-le pour allumer la LED","hi":"बटन B: LED जलाने के लिए दबाए रखें","zh":"B 按钮：按住点亮 LED"}}],"features":[{"icon":"button","text":{"de":"was_pressed() für einzelne Drücke","en":"was_pressed() for single presses","es":"was_pressed() para pulsaciones sueltas","fr":"was_pressed() pour les appuis simples","hi":"एक-एक दबाव के लिए was_pressed()","zh":"用 was_pressed() 检测单次按下"}},{"icon":"terminal","text":{"de":"print() in den seriellen Monitor","en":"print() to the serial monitor","es":"print() al monitor serie","fr":"print() vers le moniteur série","hi":"सीरियल मॉनिटर पर print()","zh":"用 print() 输出到串口监视器"}},{"icon":"led","text":{"de":"is_pressed() fürs Halten","en":"is_pressed() for holding","es":"is_pressed() para mantener pulsado","fr":"is_pressed() pour le maintien","hi":"दबाए रखने के लिए is_pressed()","zh":"用 is_pressed() 检测按住"}}],"hints":[{"de":"Kein Zählerstand im seriellen Monitor? Öffne ihn mit 115200 Baud.","en":"No count in the serial monitor? Open it at 115200 baud.","es":"¿No aparece la cuenta en el monitor serie? Ábrelo a 115200 baudios.","fr":"Pas de compte dans le moniteur série ? Ouvrez-le à 115200 bauds.","hi":"सीरियल मॉनिटर में गिनती नहीं? उसे 115200 baud पर खोलें।","zh":"串口监视器里没有计数？以 115200 波特打开它。"},{"de":"was_pressed() vergisst den Druck, sobald es True gemeldet hat, also ruf es einmal pro Schleifendurchlauf auf.","en":"was_pressed() forgets the press once it has said True, so call it once per loop.","es":"was_pressed() olvida la pulsación en cuanto ha dicho True, así que llámalo una vez por vuelta del bucle.","fr":"was_pressed() oublie l'appui une fois qu'il a répondu True : appelez-le donc une fois par tour de boucle.","hi":"True कहने के बाद was_pressed() दबाव भूल जाता है, इसलिए इसे हर लूप में एक बार कॉल करें।","zh":"was_pressed() 一旦返回过 True 就会忘掉这次按下，所以每次循环只调用它一次。"},{"de":"Die Taster haben schon Pull-ups, also brauchen sie keine Verdrahtung.","en":"The buttons already have pull-ups, so no wiring is needed for them.","es":"Los botones ya tienen pull-ups, así que no hace falta cablearlos.","fr":"Les boutons ont déjà des pull-up : aucun câblage n'est nécessaire pour eux.","hi":"बटनों पर पहले से पुल-अप हैं, इसलिए उनके लिए कोई वायरिंग नहीं चाहिए।","zh":"按钮已经带了上拉电阻，所以它们不需要接线。"}],"kind":"lesson","lede":{"de":"Zähl die Drücke auf A mit was_pressed() und halt B gedrückt, um die LED an Pin 1 leuchten zu lassen.","en":"Count presses of A with was_pressed(), and hold B to light the LED on pin 1.","es":"Cuenta las pulsaciones de A con was_pressed() y mantén pulsado B para encender el LED del pin 1.","fr":"Comptez les appuis sur A avec was_pressed(), et maintenez B pour allumer la LED de la broche 1.","hi":"was_pressed() से A के दबाव गिनें, और पिन 1 की LED जलाने के लिए B दबाए रखें।","zh":"用 was_pressed() 统计 A 的按下次数，按住 B 点亮 1 号引脚上的 LED。"},"legacyFigure":{"circuit":"buttons","page":"/figures/boards/microbit-v2.html","sheets":["board","breadboard","schematic","power"]},"level":"input","order":2,"pins":[{"color":"grey","pin":"P5","role":{"de":"Liest LOW, wenn gedrückt","en":"Reads LOW when pressed","es":"Lee LOW cuando se pulsa","fr":"Lit LOW quand il est enfoncé","hi":"दबाने पर LOW पढ़ता है","zh":"按下时读到 LOW"},"to":{"de":"Taster A auf dem Board","en":"Button A on the board","es":"El botón A de la placa","fr":"Le bouton A de la carte","hi":"बोर्ड पर बटन A","zh":"板上的 A 按钮"}},{"color":"grey","pin":"P11","role":{"de":"Liest LOW, wenn gedrückt","en":"Reads LOW when pressed","es":"Lee LOW cuando se pulsa","fr":"Lit LOW quand il est enfoncé","hi":"दबाने पर LOW पढ़ता है","zh":"按下时读到 LOW"},"to":{"de":"Taster B auf dem Board","en":"Button B on the board","es":"El botón B de la placa","fr":"Le bouton B de la carte","hi":"बोर्ड पर बटन B","zh":"板上的 B 按钮"}},{"color":"yellow","pin":"P1","role":{"de":"An, solange B gehalten wird","en":"On while B is held","es":"Encendido mientras B está pulsado","fr":"Allumée tant que B est maintenu","hi":"B दबाए रखने तक चालू","zh":"按住 B 时点亮"},"to":{"de":"Langes Bein der LED, über 470 Ω","en":"LED long leg, through 470 Ω","es":"Pata larga del LED, a través de 470 Ω","fr":"Patte longue de la LED, à travers 470 Ω","hi":"LED की लंबी टाँग, 470 Ω के ज़रिए","zh":"经过 470 Ω 接 LED 长脚"}},{"color":"black","pin":"GND","role":{"de":"Masse","en":"Ground","es":"Tierra","fr":"Masse","hi":"ग्राउंड","zh":"地"},"to":{"de":"Kurzes Bein der LED","en":"LED short leg","es":"Pata corta del LED","fr":"Patte courte de la LED","hi":"LED की छोटी टाँग","zh":"LED 短脚"}}],"quizzes":[{"id":"buttons-quiz","questions":[{"answer":2,"id":"q1","options":[{"de":"P0","en":"P0","es":"P0","fr":"P0","hi":"P0","zh":"P0"},{"de":"P11","en":"P11","es":"P11","fr":"P11","hi":"P11","zh":"P11"},{"de":"P5","en":"P5","es":"P5","fr":"P5","hi":"P5","zh":"P5"}],"q":{"de":"Welcher Pin am Platinenstecker ist Taster A?","en":"Which edge pin is button A?","es":"¿Qué pin del borde es el botón A?","fr":"Quelle broche du connecteur de bord correspond au bouton A ?","hi":"बटन A एज का कौन-सा पिन है?","zh":"A 按钮是哪个金手指引脚？"},"why":{"de":"A ist P5 und B ist P11, jeder mit einem 10-kΩ-Pull-up, also lesen sie LOW, wenn sie gedrückt sind. Lass diese Pins für die Taster frei.","en":"A is P5 and B is P11, each with a 10 kΩ pull-up, so they read LOW when pressed. Keep those pins for the buttons.","es":"A es P5 y B es P11, cada uno con un pull-up de 10 kΩ, así que leen LOW cuando se pulsan. Deja esos pines para los botones.","fr":"A est sur P5 et B sur P11, chacun avec une pull-up de 10 kΩ : ils lisent donc LOW quand ils sont enfoncés. Gardez ces broches pour les boutons.","hi":"A है P5 और B है P11, हर एक 10 kΩ पुल-अप के साथ, इसलिए दबाने पर वे LOW पढ़ते हैं। ये पिन बटनों के लिए ही रखें।","zh":"A 是 P5，B 是 P11，各带一个 10 kΩ 上拉，所以按下时读到 LOW。把这些引脚留给按钮用。"}},{"answer":1,"id":"q2","options":[{"de":"False, die Drücke waren zu schnell","en":"False, the presses were too quick","es":"False, las pulsaciones fueron demasiado rápidas","fr":"False, les appuis étaient trop rapides","hi":"False, दबाव बहुत तेज़ थे","zh":"False，按得太快了"},{"de":"Einmal True, dann beim nächsten Aufruf False","en":"True once, then False on the next call","es":"True una vez, y luego False en la siguiente llamada","fr":"True une fois, puis False à l'appel suivant","hi":"एक बार True, फिर अगली कॉल पर False","zh":"先返回一次 True，下一次调用返回 False"},{"de":"Zweimal hintereinander True","en":"True twice in a row","es":"True dos veces seguidas","fr":"True deux fois de suite","hi":"लगातार दो बार True","zh":"连续两次 True"}],"q":{"de":"Du drückst A zwischen zwei Prüfungen zweimal. Was meldet was_pressed()?","en":"You press A twice between two checks. What does was_pressed() say?","es":"Pulsas A dos veces entre dos comprobaciones. ¿Qué dice was_pressed()?","fr":"Vous appuyez deux fois sur A entre deux vérifications. Que répond was_pressed() ?","hi":"आप दो जाँचों के बीच A दो बार दबाते हैं। was_pressed() क्या कहता है?","zh":"你在两次检查之间按了两次 A。was_pressed() 会返回什么？"},"why":{"de":"was_pressed() merkt sich, dass seit deiner letzten Frage ein Druck passiert ist, und setzt sich dann zurück. get_presses() liefert die Anzahl.","en":"was_pressed() remembers that a press happened since you last asked, then resets. get_presses() gives the count.","es":"was_pressed() recuerda que ha habido una pulsación desde la última vez que preguntaste, y luego se pone a cero. get_presses() da la cuenta.","fr":"was_pressed() retient qu'un appui a eu lieu depuis la dernière question, puis se remet à zéro. get_presses() donne le nombre.","hi":"was_pressed() याद रखता है कि पिछली बार पूछने के बाद कोई दबाव हुआ, फिर रीसेट हो जाता है। get_presses() गिनती देता है।","zh":"was_pressed() 记住自你上次询问以来是否发生过按下，然后复位。get_presses() 才给出次数。"}},{"answer":0,"id":"q3","options":[{"de":"Die LED soll nur an bleiben, solange du B hältst","en":"The LED should stay on only while you hold B","es":"El LED solo debe seguir encendido mientras mantienes pulsado B","fr":"La LED ne doit rester allumée que tant que vous maintenez B","hi":"LED सिर्फ़ तभी तक जलनी चाहिए जब तक आप B दबाए रखें","zh":"LED 应该只在你按住 B 的时候亮"},{"de":"is_pressed() zählt Drücke","en":"is_pressed() counts presses","es":"is_pressed() cuenta las pulsaciones","fr":"is_pressed() compte les appuis","hi":"is_pressed() दबाव गिनता है","zh":"is_pressed() 会统计按下次数"},{"de":"B kann was_pressed() nicht benutzen","en":"B cannot use was_pressed()","es":"B no puede usar was_pressed()","fr":"B ne peut pas utiliser was_pressed()","hi":"B, was_pressed() इस्तेमाल नहीं कर सकता","zh":"B 不能用 was_pressed()"}],"q":{"de":"Warum benutzt B hier is_pressed()?","en":"Why does B use is_pressed() here?","es":"¿Por qué aquí B usa is_pressed()?","fr":"Pourquoi B utilise-t-il is_pressed() ici ?","hi":"यहाँ B के लिए is_pressed() क्यों है?","zh":"为什么这里 B 用的是 is_pressed()？"},"why":{"de":"is_pressed() liest den Taster genau jetzt, und genau das braucht ein Leuchten beim Halten.","en":"is_pressed() reads the button right now, which is what a hold-to-light needs.","es":"is_pressed() lee el botón en este momento, que es justo lo que hace falta para encender el LED mientras se mantiene pulsado.","fr":"is_pressed() lit le bouton à l'instant même, ce dont a besoin un « maintenir pour allumer ».","hi":"is_pressed() बटन को इसी पल पढ़ता है, और दबाए-रखो-तो-जले के लिए यही चाहिए।","zh":"is_pressed() 读取按钮此刻的状态，这正是“按住才亮”所需要的。"}}]}],"serialSample":{"baud":115200,"lines":["A pressed 1","A pressed 2"]},"specs":[{"label":{"de":"Taster","en":"Buttons","es":"Botones","fr":"Boutons","hi":"बटन","zh":"按钮"},"value":{"de":"A an P5, B an P11","en":"A on P5, B on P11","es":"A en P5, B en P11","fr":"A sur P5, B sur P11","hi":"A, P5 पर, B, P11 पर","zh":"A 在 P5 上，B 在 P11 上"}},{"label":{"de":"Pull-ups","en":"Pull-ups","es":"Pull-ups","fr":"Pull-up","hi":"पुल-अप","zh":"上拉电阻"},"value":{"de":"10 kΩ auf dem Board","en":"10 kΩ on the board","es":"10 kΩ en la placa","fr":"10 kΩ sur la carte","hi":"बोर्ड पर 10 kΩ","zh":"板上的 10 kΩ"}},{"label":{"de":"Serial","en":"Serial","es":"Serie","fr":"Série","hi":"सीरियल","zh":"串口"},"value":{"de":"115200 Baud","en":"115200 baud","es":"115200 baudios","fr":"115200 bauds","hi":"115200 baud","zh":"115200 波特"}}],"starter":{"source":"src_main","template":"# Count A presses, hold B to light pin 1\nfrom microbit import *\n\ncount = 0\nwhile True:\n    if button_a.was_pressed():    # True once after each press\n        count += 1\n        display.show(Image.HAPPY)\n        print(\"A pressed\", count)\n    if button_b.is_pressed():     # True for as long as B is held\n        pin1.write_digital(1)\n        display.show(Image.SAD)\n    else:\n        pin1.write_digital(0)\n    sleep({{p:poll}})\n"},"steps":[{"de":"Lass die LED aus der Blink-Lektion an Ring 1.","en":"Keep the LED on ring 1 from the blink lesson.","es":"Deja el LED del anillo 1 de la lección del parpadeo.","fr":"Gardez la L